<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Encurte links.<br>Compartilhe com um clique.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Cole qualquer URL longa e receba um link curto, rastreável e pronto para compartilhar em segundos.</p>
        <form id="urlForm" class="shortener-form">
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <input type="url" placeholder="https://exemplo.com/sua-url-muito-longa" name="url" id="urlInput" class="shortener-input" required autocomplete="url">
            <button type="submit" class="shortener-btn" id="submitBtn">Encurtar</button>
          </div>
        </form>
        <div id="result" class="result-card is-hidden">
          <div class="result-success">
            <span class="result-label">Link criado</span>
            <div class="result-url-row">
              <a id="shortUrl" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="result-short-link"></a>
              <button type="button" class="btn-copy" id="copyBtn">Copiar</button>
            </div>
            <p class="result-original">Original: <span id="originalUrl"></span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="error" class="result-card result-error is-hidden">
          <span class="result-error-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
          <span id="errorMessage"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="link-mock">
          <span class="link-mock-bar"></span>
          <span class="link-mock-bar short"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
      <div class="features-inner">
        <h2 class="features-title">Por que usar?</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <h3>Rápido</h3>
            <p>Gere links curtos em menos de um segundo. Sem cadastro, sem espera.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <h3>Confiável</h3>
            <p>Links estáveis e redirecionamento seguro para o destino original.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <h3>Simples</h3>
            <p>Interface limpa. Veja todas as suas URLs encurtadas em um só lugar.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/javascripts/shortener.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
